  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Trade for Development-economic cooperation for Australia&#x2019;s Free Trade Agreements with ASEAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Regional Trade for Development (RT4D) investment responds to ASEAN&#x2019;s priorities for trade policy capacity building and economic cooperation to implement and maximise the benefits of the ASEAN-Australia-New Zealand FTA (AANZFTA) and the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership (RCEP) Agreement. RT4D mainstreams Gender Equality, Disability and Social Inclusion (GEDSI) principles into its activities and collaborates with the Trade and Gender Equality Incubator (TGEI) to further research and pilot initiatives that advance gender equality within trade.</narrative>
  </description>
